@startuml seq-gui-observer-refresh
title GUI observer refresh - a pantry add updates the shopping list and the tabs (Observer, Command)
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor User
participant PantryTab
participant CommandHistory
participant AddPantryItemCommand
participant Pantry
participant ShoppingListGenerator
participant "ObserverBinding\n(ShoppingTab)" as Binding
participant FxUiThread
participant ShoppingTab
participant UndoRedoToolBar

User -> PantryTab : fill form, click Add
PantryTab -> PantryTab : PantryForm.parse (field errors)
PantryTab -> CommandHistory : pushAndExecute(new AddPantryItemCommand)
CommandHistory -> AddPantryItemCommand : execute()
AddPantryItemCommand -> Pantry : addItem(item)
Pantry -> ShoppingListGenerator : onStateChanged (Observer)
ShoppingListGenerator -> ShoppingListGenerator : generate()
ShoppingListGenerator -> Binding : onStateChanged
Binding -> FxUiThread : run(refresh)
FxUiThread -> ShoppingTab : refresh() on the FX thread
CommandHistory -> UndoRedoToolBar : notify -> refresh labels\n(through its own ObserverBinding)
note over Pantry, ShoppingListGenerator : the same chain runs for CLI changes;\nthe CLI's CLIConsoleView prints "[update] ..."
@enduml
